  "description": "Yoon Jung-woo is a lawyer handling a lawsuit regarding a fatal fire. He meets Park Hae-on, a firefighter who was present at the scene and is also a suspect, as a witness. The bereaved family, who hired Jung-woo, believes the accident was caused by Hae-on's corruption. Just as sharp tension hangs between the two, Jung-woo becomes aroused by Hae-on's pheromones and falls into rut. As an Alpha, Jung-woo naturally assumes Hae-on is an Omega, but in fact, Hae-on is also an Alpha. Mistaking each other for Omegas, the two Alphas gradually become entangled as the lawsuit progresses.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/scent_of_embers)",
